WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.203
This is "Late Night." We hope
everybody's doing well tonight.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.938
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.938 --> 00:00:07.706
President Biden said yesterday

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:11.111
that he plans to deliver
a speech about aid for Ukraine.

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:14.047
And to make sure people tune in,
he promised to go

00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:16.049
no teleprompter.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.717
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:18.985
While leaving
the courtroom yesterday

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:20.987
during the third day
of his civil fraud trial,

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.123
former President Trump
told reporters

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.824
he would rather be in Iowa.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.994
And now he's also facing
one count of perjury.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:30.329
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.298
According to a new study,
mortgage applications

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.133
have hit a nearly
three-decade low,

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:37.470
which is bad news for people
who just lost their house.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.804
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:40.373
New York Mayor Eric Adams

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.109
began a four-day tour
of Latin America yesterday

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.878
and plans to dissuade migrants
from traveling to the city.

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.080
Apparently, he's gonna do it
by telling them

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.149
that he's the mayor.

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:52.318
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:55.287
In a new interview, Republican
Senator Markwayne Mullin

00:00:55.287 --> 00:00:57.357
criticized Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:58.724
and said that Gaetz
had bragged

00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:00.993
that he would crush
erectile dysfunction medicine

00:01:00.993 --> 00:01:02.995
and, quote, "chase it
with energy drinks

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:04.330
so he could go all night."

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.565
He added...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.933
He added that sometimes

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.435
Gaetz would even have
a woman with him.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.504
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:14.874
[ Laughter continues ]

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.742
After The New York Times
reported yesterday

00:01:16.742 --> 00:01:18.077
that federal prosecutors

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.746
are investigating
his drinking habits,

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.014
Rudy Giuliani
told reporters, quote,

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:24.517
"I do not have
an alcohol problem.

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.219
I have never had
an alcohol problem."

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.420
Rudy, man...

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.988
they're giving you
a perfect excuse.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.658
Take the off-ramp.

00:01:31.658 --> 00:01:33.659
Do you really want people
to think you helped

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:36.095
an insurrectionist, went
to the wrong Four Seasons,

00:01:36.095 --> 00:01:37.563
leaked hair dye,

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:40.066
and wore these shorts

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.402
while you were
stone-cold sober?

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:44.437
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.605
After it was reported...

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.206
They put -- If you wear
those shorts,

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:50.209
that's a -- that's
a drunk driving test.

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:52.044
They pull you over and they go,
"You want to put these on?"

00:01:52.044 --> 00:01:53.212
If you're like,
"Yeah, I'll put them on,"

00:01:53.212 --> 00:01:55.881
they're like,
"Get in the car."

00:01:55.881 --> 00:01:57.583
After it was reported
that prosecutors

00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:58.918
are investigating
his drinking habits,

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.620
Rudy Giuliani
told reporters, quote,

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.121
"If I have an alcohol problem,

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.757
I should be in the Guinness
Book of World Records."

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:07.093
But it turns out
he already is.

00:02:07.093 --> 00:02:09.129
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:14.367
Russian President Vladimir Putin
turns 71 on Saturday.

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:17.570
He's gonna celebrate
by pushing a cake off a balcony.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.405
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:19.405 --> 00:02:21.407
Ohhhh.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.243
You guys must love cake.

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.579
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.480
In a new statement
about climate change,

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:30.850
Pope Francis criticized
fossil fuel companies

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.052
and said the transition
toward renewable energy

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:36.155
is, quote, "not progressing
at the necessary speed."

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:38.724
And you know you're in trouble
when the Catholic Church

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:41.227
thinks you're stuck
in the past.

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.229
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.430
A resident of

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.599
the Florida retirement community
The Villages

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.534
was arrested recently
after he allegedly

00:02:48.534 --> 00:02:50.636
stockpiled nearly $2,000 worth

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:53.005
of erectile dysfunction drugs
to sell,

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:55.875
continuing the long tradition
of drug dealers yelling,

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.378
"Say hello to my little friend."

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:00.846
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:04.483
And finally, Katmai
National Park in Alaska

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:07.319
today kicked off its annual
Fat Bear Week contest.

00:03:07.319 --> 00:03:10.222
Unfortunately, since they were
all shamed last year,

00:03:10.222 --> 00:03:12.224
they went on Ozempic.

00:03:12.224 --> 00:03:14.260
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:17.864
[ Laughs ]

00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:19.431
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:03:19.431 --> 00:03:20.900
We got a good show
for you tonight.

